# CastMane ships no credentials and needs none: the Wayland portal session
# tokens are generated at runtime over D-Bus and never stored.
# This file exists only as a safety net (it is tracked on purpose while
# `.env` / `.env.*` stay git-ignored): if a local integration ever needs a
# token, copy this file to `.env` and put secrets there — never in code.
# Example:
# CASTMANE_SOME_SERVICE_TOKEN=
